                "fallback": "Tania Saez - Iytro | LinkedIn",
                "text": "B2B marketing is becoming tougher and tougher - B2B frameworks are broken - More leads don&amp;#39;t mean more revenue.\n\nDo you want to achieve your business objectives but don&amp;#39;t want to:\n:x:Waste time and budget \n:x:Feel like your efforts are in vain \n\nI help B2B teams whose clients have long and complex processes get more pipeline opportunities and increase revenue by using ABM, Demandgen, and RevOps methodologies. I&amp;#39;ve already helped + 20 global clients in Europe and North America.\n\nMost B2B teams are stuck in the lead and content hamster wheel.\nVery few companies how effective DemandGen and ABM can be.\n\nDid you know that:\n- Only 3% of your prospects are in-market at a precise moment?\n- Companies using ABM generate 208% more revenue for their marketing efforts? According to a Marketo study\n- 69% of businesses saw improved pipeline conversion rates by using ABM strategies and by streamlining their Revenue Operations? According to an InsideView report\n\nIf you are:\n\n:x:Frustrated at getting no good leads and not having an impact on your company\n:x:Feeling that you are just spraying and praying\n:x:Working too hard and getting not the desired results. Not to talk about the ROI!\n\nSome of my major career achievements:trophy::\n:white_check_mark: I managed to scale\/growth hack 2 high growth startups in European markets and the American market going from €100k turnover to millions\n:white_check_mark: I launched 50 new products in 30 new countries.\n:white_check_mark: I Launched my e-commerce startup, 80Days, reached scalability and received international media coverage &amp;quot;\n\nIf you&amp;#39;re ready for the change, book a strategy call with me: <https:\/\/meetings-eu1.hubspot.com\/tsaez>\n\nFields I specialize in and some of the tools I use:hammer_and_wrench:\n:point_right:ABM &amp; DemandGen :mag_right:: LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Sales Outreach\/Outbound Marketing\/Marketing and Sales Automation (Hubspot ABM Module, Demand Base, <http:\/\/Reply.io|Reply.io>, Lemlist, <http:\/\/Snov.io|Snov.io>, Vidyard, Calendly), Intent data (Apollo, Clearbit, Zoominfo), Zapier among many others.\n:point_right:General growth toolset:rocket:: Hotjar, Google Data Studio, Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager\n:point_right:Inbound :books::writing_hand:: Hubspot, Mailchimp, Semrush, Folk.. · Experience: Iytro · Education: Growth Hacking Course · Location: France · 500+ connections on LinkedIn. View Tania Saez’s profile on LinkedIn, a professional community of 1 billion members.",
